WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
The Accusation.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:16.337
Individuals within the RCMP, Canadian Forces Military Police, and municipal and provincial police agencies are guilty of offences that under Canada's own historical national security laws constituted capital crimes.

00:00:16.337 --> 00:00:24.475
Silencing dissent, suppressing evidence, pathologizing whistleblowers, and facilitating a state-administered killing program.
